observations.recommendation:
According to the policy mentioned as “2. Accounting Operations at Hotel” in the INDEX;
“Hotel Accountant shall also keep / maintain record of all online and traditional transactions e.g. vouchers, bank reconciliation statements, quotations etc.”
It is suggested that at the month end, accountant should print a voucher list from BEAMS, and match the record to ensure completion of record. Entries posted by Head Office, may be marked on the voucher list, for future reference.

It is recommended that all cash sales be deposited on a daily basis, and that expenses or payouts be processed in accordance with the prescribed procedures to ensure transparency and strengthen financial controls. As per prescribed procedure mentioned as “2. Accounting Operations at Hotel” in the INDEX;
“Cash received through cash sales both for room-let and in restaurant shall be deposited by accountant at day end on daily basis, in case of bank holiday, the cash shall be kept in safe under supervision of GM Hotel. 
“All the cash collected shall be deposited into Company designated bank account on daily basis.”
